Zogtzhe noch amo!
Un take noch amol

1004
01:10:02,574 --> 01:10:06,078
Komets alefo

1005
01:10:07,495 --> 01:10:08,872
(WHISTLE BLOWING)

1006
01:10:09,038 --> 01:10:12,463
Zogtzhe noch amol un take noch amol

1007
01:10:12,959 --> 01:10:15,963
Komets alefo

1008
