1537
01:53:20,919 --> 01:53:24,093
What would that be like, I wonder? I mean...

1538
01:53:25,257 --> 01:53:27,056
What would be wrong with that?

1539
01:53:28,135 --> 01:53:31,856
I realize that you're not a person in

1540
01:53:31,930 --> 01:53:34,074
