2405
03:02:22,890 --> 03:02:24,563
Have you been in Poland?

2406
03:02:24,725 --> 03:02:26,077
I just came from Poland.

2407
03:02:29,439 --> 03:02:31,191
Are there any Jews left?

2408
03:02:37,321 --> 03:02:38,823
